kwd (Kube Watch Dog) is a configuration-first CLI that checks Kubernetes
workload readiness from a YAML profile. It is read-only toward the cluster
and uses client-go (no kubectl subprocess for checks).

The package installs the static binary, the kubectl-kwd plugin shim, man
pages, the MIT license text, and a sample configuration under
share/examples/kwd/.

WWW: https://github.com/hrodrig/kwd
